<title>USA: MOTOR RACING-LEADING QUALIFIERS FOR MONTEREY INDYCAR.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-LEADING QUALIFIERS FOR MONTEREY INDYCAR.</headline>
<dateline>MONTEREY, California 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Top ten drivers</p>
<p>after final qualifying on Saturday for the Grand Prix of</p>
<p>Monterey IndyCar race (tabulate by driver, country, chassis,</p>
<p>motor, lap time):</p>
<p>1. Alessandro Zanardi (Italy), Reynard Honda, 68.004 seconds</p>
<p>(118.475 mph/190.661 kph)</p>
<p>2. Bryan Herta (U.S.), Reynard Mercedes-Benz, 68.019</p>
<p>3. Mauricio Gugelmin (Brazil), Reynard Ford Cosworth, 68.188</p>
<p>4. Mark Blundell (Britain), Reynard Ford Cosworth, 68.232</p>
<p>5. Jimmy Vasser (U.S.), Reynard Honda, 68.296</p>
<p>6. Greg Moore (Canada), Reynard Mercedes-Benz, 68.679</p>
<p>7. Andre Ribeiro (Brazil), Lola Honda, 68.739</p>
<p>8. Christian Fittipaldi (Brazil), Lola Ford Cosworth, 68.757</p>
<p>9. Bobby Rahal (U.S.), Reynard Mercedes-Benz, 68.783</p>
<p>10. Scott Pruett (U.S.), Lola Ford Cosworth, 68.830</p>
</text>
